WEBVTT

00:07:29.778 --> 00:07:32.698
We have high-quality information,

00:07:32.698 --> 00:07:35.576
facts and data that allow us to do things

00:07:35.618 --> 00:07:38.871
like track the migration
of endangered species

00:07:38.913 --> 00:07:41.707
or the spread of a pandemic
around the world.

00:07:41.749 --> 00:07:44.418
These are useful tools in our toolbox,

00:07:44.460 --> 00:07:47.338
but they don't necessarily
alone change minds

00:07:47.379 --> 00:07:49.215
or unite disparate views.

00:07:49.632 --> 00:07:51.091
So how do we do that?

00:07:51.675 --> 00:07:54.637
We shift from focusing on one key truth

00:07:54.678 --> 00:07:57.890
to instead finding minimum viable truth.

00:07:58.390 --> 00:08:01.644
Minimum viable truth means
getting it right enough